                                "sense_id": "b5c2b7cb-cd70-33cb-9858-473564a0c8c8",
                                "text": "In a dulocracy who are the slaves?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47e018dc-0725-48f9-baac-de707bf8577b",
                                "sense_id": "b5c2b7cb-cd70-33cb-9858-473564a0c8c8",
                                "text": "Or must the country passively submit to that dulocracy in politics which has become a stigma upon the nation, and a shame to the intelligence of the people?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b61eac88-2f84-4277-8a56-c3159b67d1f6",
                                "sense_id": "b5c2b7cb-cd70-33cb-9858-473564a0c8c8",
                                "text": "Manderians are not democrats; they are dulocrats, and the Manderweb symbolises our dulocracy. So, are you surprised that the dulocracy rules our country […] A dulocracy is \"a Government where servants and slaves have so much license and privilege that they domineer\" (Black's Law Dictionary, 6th edn), […]"
